#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/indexing-and-slicing.rst:30
msgid ""
"When fewer indices than axes are supplied, the unindexed axes are left "
"intact. The result is a *reduced-rank view* of the source::"
msgstr ""
"Kun indeksejä annetaan vähemmän kuin akseleita, indeksoimattomat akselit "
